{"id":358,"gn":"Pokémon Carillon","ft":["Ses cris se répercutent dans son corps creux avant d’exploser en notes mélodieuses et saisissantes.","Il se suspend sous une branche ou un auvent avec la ventouse de sa tête. Son langage comporte sept cris.","Il émet des cris à ultrasons et chevauche le vent pour parcourir de grandes distances.","Éoko fait résonner son cri dans son corps creux. Lorsque ce Pokémon est en colère, les échos de son cri génèrent des ultrasons capables d’envoyer voler des ennemis.","Lorsqu’il y a beaucoup de vent, Éoko pousse des cris, accroché à une branche ou à un auvent par une ventouse placée sur sa tête. Ce Pokémon attrape des Baies avec sa longue queue pour les manger."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":1,"24":2,"25":3,"26":4},"gr":4,"cr":45,"hc":25,"bh":70,"eg":["Amorphe"],"gw":"fast","gm":{"zadlc":[0,51],"svmask":[0,143],"sv":[1,143],"la":[0,196],"bdsp":[0,83],"oras":[0,158],"xy":[1,112],"pt":[0,83],"dp":[0,83],"e":[0,151],"rs":[0,151]},"f":{"358":{"n":"Éoko","t":["psychic"],"s":[75,50,80,95,90,65],"h":0.6,"w":1,"a":[[26,0]],"ps":[[6,[65,50,70,95,80,65]]],"av":["zadlc","svmask","sv","la","bdsp","oras","xy","pt","dp","e","rs"],"hi":[[175,5,[12,13,14,15,16,17,18,21,22]],[201,5,[25,26,27,28,29,30]]],"ls":[{"l":[[35,1],[45,1],[93,1],[310,1],[361,1],[281,13],[500,16],[36,19],[326,22],[215,27],[253,32],[219,37],[38,42],[505,47]],"m":[36,38,60,86,94,113,115,129,156,164,174,182,196,203,204,214,226,227,240,241,244,247,248,253,263,269,270,271,282,285,286,304,313,347,356,412,428,433,447,451,473,500,555,574,577,605,797,851,917],"e":[50,95,105,174,273,278,322,502]},{"l":[[33,1],[93,6],[466,11],[95,18],[326,25],[105,34],[38,43]]},{"l":[[310,1],[93,1],[494,1],[45,1],[361,1],[387,1],[35,1],[45,4],[310,7],[93,10],[281,13],[113,16],[36,19],[326,22],[215,27],[253,32],[219,37],[38,42],[505,47],[94,52],[361,57]],"m":[86,94,104,113,115,138,148,156,164,182,203,207,213,214,219,240,241,244,247,259,263,269,278,285,347,351,412,433,447,451,605],"e":[50,95,105,174,195,248,273,